{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13212140","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13212140","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1321214001:0":{"text":"不！这幅画我画了整整一个月！","source_cn":"不！这幅画我画了整整一个月！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2C8D2B095A0F322E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:2::0":{"text":"被弄花的画作","source_cn":"被弄花的画作","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7C5D868438995C19","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1321214002:1":{"text":"啊……小雪人好像刚刚撞倒了画框。","source_cn":"啊……小雪人好像刚刚撞倒了画框。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBAF9EDE7C47BAA70","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1321214003:1":{"text":"对不起呀……好像蹭到了点色块，画点什么补救一下？","source_cn":"对不起呀……好像蹭到了点色块，画点什么补救一下？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBB01F9E015C790B8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1321214004:1":{"text":"我果然画不出完美的作品……","source_cn":"我果然画不出完美的作品……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3ADF5C23D55218AA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1321214005:1":{"text":"要不重新开始……","source_cn":"要不重新开始……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD6EF2ADDEF7DB516","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1321214006:1":{"text":"咱都听不下去了！","source_cn":"咱都听不下去了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3018A400004EDFBA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1321214007:1":{"text":"噫——你怎么突然开口说话！吓死我了。","source_cn":"噫——你怎么突然开口说话！吓死我了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x528A750A2960E412","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1321214008:1":{"text":"这、这是什么！是我疯了吗？雪人在说话？","source_cn":"这、这是什么！是我疯了吗？雪人在说话？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9FC50EC34D0CBF00","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1321214009:1":{"text":"你！对，就是你！拿着画笔的这个！","source_cn":"你！对，就是你！拿着画笔的这个！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x63C1E8243D317533","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1321214010:1":{"text":"你不是很想见这位大师吗？","source_cn":"你不是很想见这位大师吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1759974B565671AB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1321214011:1":{"text":"当、当然！我为此跑到荒郊野岭，堆了一周雪人，画了足足一个月！","source_cn":"当、当然！我为此跑到荒郊野岭，堆了一周雪人，画了足足一个月！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5FC0F1592C719542","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1321214012:1":{"text":"那就去见这位偶像啊！","source_cn":"那就去见这位偶像啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x117BB11AD8DBEDE7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1321214013:1":{"text":"可、可是……我没有拿得出手的作品。","source_cn":"可、可是……我没有拿得出手的作品。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE39AB1611800A39B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1321214014:1":{"text":"受不了你们这些有一堆时间可以浪费的！","source_cn":"受不了你们这些有一堆时间可以浪费的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x500E34435F111729","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1321214015:1":{"text":"你拖了这么久，就没想过：你偶像有可能离开吗？","source_cn":"你拖了这么久，就没想过：你偶像有可能离开吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x920FD6BD0E6768A6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1321214016:1":{"text":"我……我当然担心！","source_cn":"我……我当然担心！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFD166136378910ED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1321214017:1":{"text":"万一错过了，你不后悔吗？","source_cn":"万一错过了，你不后悔吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x30FD51A722140562","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1321214018:1":{"text":"错过的话，我肯定会后悔一辈子！","source_cn":"错过的话，我肯定会后悔一辈子！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0AF494DA780342B6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1321214019:1":{"text":"一旦错过了，可能你们这辈子都不一定能再见面了！","source_cn":"一旦错过了，可能你们这辈子都不一定能再见面了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBE54AC81CACA304B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1321214020:1":{"text":"我，我……确实，可是……","source_cn":"我，我……确实，可是……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF3B95113EFA00344","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1321214021:1":{"text":"那就不要这么瞻前顾后的！现在！立马出发！","source_cn":"那就不要这么瞻前顾后的！现在！立马出发！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE93EDF958A90139F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1321214022:1":{"text":"你要是只有一周的时间，肯定要把想做的赶紧做完呀！","source_cn":"你要是只有一周的时间，肯定要把想做的赶紧做完呀！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFB92ED7FD84070C7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1321214023:1":{"text":"你看咱，如果不抓紧时间去看眼野花，雪生短暂，化了就再也没机会了！","source_cn":"你看咱，如果不抓紧时间去看眼野花，雪生短暂，化了就再也...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAE72C89B87528F76","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1321214024:1":{"text":"你们就是时间太多！总觉得还有机会，才这么瞻前顾后！","source_cn":"你们就是时间太多！总觉得还有机会，才这么瞻前顾后！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB04D1CF2347EF475","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1321214025:1":{"text":"你、你说得也对……","source_cn":"你、你说得也对……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x13155F73B0558DF3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1321214026:1":{"text":"唉！你别拉我，我补一下这个画痕……","source_cn":"唉！你别拉我，我补一下这个画痕……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x07E1038909E65AF0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1321214027:1":{"text":"这个的话，补一个雪人吧……就是你了！","source_cn":"